note Exercism-style exercise "resistor-color": https://exercism.org/tracks/python/exercises/resistor-color
note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception
note The band colors in value order are black brown red orange yellow green blue violet grey white
note (0 .. 9). colorcode is the value of color (10 when it is not a band color); colors writes all
note the band colors in value order, joined by commas, into o and returns the number of bytes written.
note Check it with: sh exercise.sh exercises/resistor-color
om2
fn colorcode color view uchar * to ulong
note replace this line with your solution
trap 13
end
fn colors o edit uchar * to ulong
note replace this line with your solution
trap 13
end
